(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY - DEPARTMENT OF SCIENCE & TECHNOLOGY) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: NIDHI-SEED SUPPORT SYSTEM \(NIDHI-SSS\) \(NIDHI-SSS\) / NATIONAL SCIENCE & TECHNOLOGY ENTREPRENEURSHIP DEVELOPMENT BOARD \(NSTEDB\) / TBIS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Debt and equity seed financing up to Rs. 1 Crore for technology-driven) Tj
T*
(startups incubated in DST-supported Technology Business Incubators \(TBIs\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Registered startup incubated in a DST-approved Technology Business) Tj
T*
(   Incubator \(TBI\) for at least 3 months.) Tj
T*
(2. Focus on commercializing indigenous, science-backed technologies and) Tj
T*
(   proprietary engineering.) Tj
T*
(3. Indian promoter holding must be at least 51%.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Financial seed support between Rs. 25 Lakh and Rs. 100 Lakh per startup via) Tj
T*
(   equity investment, convertible debentures, or soft loan.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 1.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Certificate of Incorporation) Tj
T*
(2. TBI Incubation Agreement) Tj
T*
(3. Product Technical Architecture and Test Reports) Tj
T*
(4. Audited Accounts / Projected Financial Model) Tj
T*
(5. Patent / IP filing documents) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Through host Technology Business Incubator \(TBI\)) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.nstedb.com/institutional/NIDHI-SSS.htm) Tj
T*
